# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn which time-based usage fields in the IBM Quantum Compute API to disregard, and which resource unit (RU) fields replace them."
msgstr "Pelajari field penggunaan berbasis waktu mana di IBM Quantum Compute API yang perlu diabaikan, dan field resource unit (RU) mana yang menggantikannya."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API"
msgstr "Migrasi ke resource unit (RU) di IBM Quantum Compute API"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate to resource units (RUs) in the IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"
msgstr "Migrasi ke resource unit (RU) di IBM Quantum Compute API {#migrate-to-resource-units-rus-in-the-ibm-quantum-compute-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum&reg; Platform now measures usage in resource units (RUs). An RU is the unit that IBM Quantum uses to measure and bill the usage of all workloads. Before this change, the platform measured usage as QPU time in seconds or milliseconds. For more information about RUs, see [Resource units](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum&reg; Platform kini mengukur penggunaan dalam resource unit (RU). RU adalah satuan yang dipakai IBM Quantum untuk mengukur dan menagih penggunaan semua workload. Sebelum perubahan ini, platform mengukur penggunaan sebagai waktu QPU dalam detik atau milidetik. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang RU, lihat [Resource unit](/guides/plans-overview#resource-units).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, the API returns two sets of fields: the old time fields and the new RU fields. Your integration continues to work. In a future release, IBM Quantum will remove the time fields. Change your integration to read the RU fields now.\n"
msgstr "Saat ini, API mengembalikan dua set field: field waktu yang lama dan field RU yang baru. Integrasimu tetap berjalan. Di rilis mendatang, IBM Quantum akan menghapus field waktu. Ubah integrasimu agar membaca field RU sekarang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide uses these terms:\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini memakai istilah berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Workload**: A job, a session, a batch, or a function run.\n"
msgstr "**Workload**: Sebuah job, session, batch, atau eksekusi function.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU workload**: A job, a session, or a batch. A QPU workload runs only on a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**QPU workload**: Sebuah job, session, atau batch. QPU workload hanya berjalan di QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Function workload**: A function run. A function workload can use classical compute and an execution license, and it can also use a QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Function workload**: Satu eksekusi function. Function workload bisa memakai komputasi klasik dan lisensi eksekusi, dan juga bisa memakai QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Session**: A group of jobs that run together on one QPU.\n"
msgstr "**Session**: Sekelompok job yang berjalan bersama di satu QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance**: A service instance. It owns workloads and has usage limits.\n"
msgstr "**Instance**: Sebuah service instance. Instance memiliki workload dan punya batas penggunaan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Plan**: The service plan of an account. It sets the usage limits for all instances in the account.\n"
msgstr "**Plan**: Service plan dari sebuah akun. Plan menetapkan batas penggunaan untuk semua instance di akun tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  This guide uses version 0.57.2 of the [OpenAPI spec](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Panduan ini memakai versi 0.57.2 dari [OpenAPI spec](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/openapi.json).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  The `IBM-API-Version` header value must be `2026-04-15` or a later supported API version.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Nilai header `IBM-API-Version` harus `2026-04-15` atau versi API lebih baru yang didukung.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Ringkasan {#summary}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpoint | Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Membuat, memperbarui, dan membaca service instance | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Setiap field penggunaan dalam milidetik | Field yang sepadan dengan akhiran `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Bagian-bagian berikut memberikan detail untuk setiap endpoint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Job {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/jobs` dan `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "Objek `usage` juga punya field berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: Satuan dari `usage.value`. Nilainya selalu `\"resource_units\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: Status penagihan. Nilainya `\"pending\"` atau `\"complete\"`. Kalau statusnya `\"pending\"`, platform masih bisa mengubah nilainya. Jangan pakai nilai pending sebagai penggunaan final.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: Penggunaan untuk setiap metrik penagihan. `value` dari setiap entri dalam RU.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "Field `usage.details[].metric.value` bukan penggunaan dalam RU. Field ini adalah kuantitas metrik yang dipakai platform untuk menghitung RU. Setiap metrik punya satuannya sendiri. Misalnya, satuan metrik QPU adalah detik. Untuk penggunaan, baca `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Workload {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Setiap item di `workloads[]` punya objek `usage`. Objek ini punya field yang sama dengan objek `usage` milik job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Kalau sebuah workload masih berjalan, `usage` bernilai `null`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Function workload {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "Penggunaan function workload dinyatakan dalam RU, sama seperti QPU workload. Sebuah function workload bisa memakai lebih dari satu metrik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**Penggunaan QPU.** Diukur per detik waktu kuantum. Lihat [Mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Penggunaan komputasi klasik.** Diukur per detik [waktu klasik](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Biaya lisensi eksekusi.** Diukur per workload, berdasarkan [ukuran masalah yang diberikan ke sebuah function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "Platform mengonversi kuantitas setiap metrik ke RU. Jadi, semua nilai penggunaan dalam RU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.value` adalah penggunaan workload, dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].value` adalah penggunaan untuk satu metrik, dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].metric.value` adalah kuantitas metrik, dalam satuan metrik tersebut. Nilai ini bukan dalam RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu menampilkan atau menjumlahkan nilai penggunaan, pakai `usage.value` dan `usage.details[].value`. Jangan pakai `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Session {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `POST /v1/sessions` dan `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (detik) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "Objek `usage` milik session punya `unit` dan `details[]`. Field-field ini bekerja sama seperti di objek `usage` milik job, kecuali field `status` yang dihilangkan untuk session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "Field `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, dan `active_ttl` tidak berubah. Field ini adalah batas waktu (TTL artinya \"time to live\"), bukan penggunaan. Satuannya tetap detik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage {#instance-usage}"
msgstr "Penggunaan instance {#instance-usage}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, and `time_available_at` do not change.\n"
msgstr "Field `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, dan `time_available_at` tidak berubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account plans {#account-plans}"
msgstr "Plan akun {#account-plans}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `plans[]` has these changes:\n"
msgstr "Setiap item di `plans[]` punya perubahan berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Abaikan | Baca ini sebagai gantinya |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Service instance di Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API adalah API terpisah. Kamu memakainya untuk membuat dan memperbarui service instance. Kalau kamu membuat atau memperbarui instance dengan API ini, ubah juga parameter instance-nya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Saat membuat atau memperbarui instance, kirim parameter berikut dalam request:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jangan kirim | Kirim sebagai gantinya | Tipe parameter baru |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number atau `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number atau `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Arti parameter-parameter tersebut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Batas instance**Penggunaan maksimum untuk instance. Kalau kamu tidak mengirim batas di Open Plan, defaultnya adalah setara RU dari 10 menit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Alokasi penggunaan**: Bagian penggunaan untuk instance. Fair-share scheduler memakai nilai ini untuk menetapkan prioritas instance di antrean. Alokasi tidak berlaku untuk instance Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Saat kamu membaca sebuah instance, objek `extensions` di respons berisi field lama dan field baru. Abaikan `instance_limit_seconds` dan `usage_allocation_seconds`. Baca `instance_limit_ru` dan `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi REST API IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analitik penggunaan {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, dan `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Ketiga endpoint ini punya field penggunaan yang sama. Dua endpoint berkelompok mengembalikan field ini untuk setiap grup atau setiap tanggal.\n"

