# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total in `usage_ru` includes more than the total in `usage`:\n"
msgstr "Total di `usage_ru` mencakup lebih banyak daripada total di `usage`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage` is the sum of QPU time for sessions, individual jobs, and functions.\n"
msgstr "`usage` adalah jumlah waktu QPU untuk session, job individual, dan function.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_ru` is the sum of usage for sessions, individual jobs, and functions. For functions, it also includes classical compute and license cost.\n"
msgstr "`usage_ru` adalah jumlah penggunaan untuk session, job individual, dan function. Untuk function, nilai ini juga mencakup komputasi klasik dan biaya lisensi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, `usage_ru` is not only `usage` in a different unit.\n"
msgstr "Jadi, `usage_ru` bukan sekadar `usage` dalam satuan yang berbeda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` do not change. They measure wait time, not usage. Their unit stays milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Field `queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, dan `max_queue_time` tidak berubah. Field ini mengukur waktu tunggu, bukan penggunaan. Satuannya tetap milidetik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields that do not change {#fields-that-do-not-change}"
msgstr "Field yang tidak berubah {#fields-that-do-not-change}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These fields contain time values, but they do not measure usage. IBM Quantum does not plan to replace them:\n"
msgstr "Field-field ini berisi nilai waktu, tetapi tidak mengukur penggunaan. IBM Quantum tidak berencana menggantinya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`wait_time_seconds` on backends: The estimated wait in the queue.\n"
msgstr "`wait_time_seconds` pada backend: Perkiraan waktu tunggu di antrean.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`circuits_execution_time_ns` in `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: The time that the job ran on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "`circuits_execution_time_ns` di `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`: Waktu job berjalan di QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` on sessions.\n"
msgstr "`interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, dan `active_ttl` pada session.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, and `max_queue_time` in analytics.\n"
msgstr "`queue_time`, `avg_queue_time`, dan `max_queue_time` di analitik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`rep_times` and `circuit_duration` in backend configuration.\n"
msgstr "`rep_times` dan `circuit_duration` di konfigurasi backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration steps {#migration-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah migrasi {#migration-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find each old field in your code. Search for `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, the `_seconds` fields in this guide, and the analytics fields in milliseconds.\n"
msgstr "Temukan setiap field lama di kodemu. Cari `qpu_charge_time_seconds`, `elapsed_time`, field `_seconds` di panduan ini, dan field analitik dalam milidetik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change each old field to the RU field in the tables of this guide.\n"
msgstr "Ubah setiap field lama ke field RU yang ada di tabel panduan ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you create or update service instances with the Resource Controller API, send `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`. Do not send the `_seconds` parameters.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu membuat atau memperbarui service instance dengan Resource Controller API, kirim `instance_limit_ru` dan `usage_allocation_ru`. Jangan kirim parameter `_seconds`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the labels in your user interface. Show \"RU\" or \"resource units\", not \"seconds\" or \"minutes\". Do not convert RUs to time. There is no fixed rate between RUs and time.\n"
msgstr "Ubah label di antarmuka penggunamu. Tampilkan \"RU\" atau \"resource unit\", bukan \"detik\" atau \"menit\". Jangan konversi RU ke waktu. Tidak ada rasio tetap antara RU dan waktu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you read `usage.details[]`, use `value` for the usage in RUs. Do not use `metric.value`, because its unit is the unit of the metric.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu membaca `usage.details[]`, pakai `value` untuk penggunaan dalam RU. Jangan pakai `metric.value`, karena satuannya adalah satuan metrik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If `usage.status` is `\"pending\"`, show the value as provisional.\n"
msgstr "Kalau `usage.status` bernilai `\"pending\"`, tampilkan nilainya sebagai sementara.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an RU field is missing or `null`, use the same logic that you use for the old field today.\n"
msgstr "Kalau field RU hilang atau `null`, pakai logika yang sama dengan yang kamu pakai untuk field lama saat ini.\n"
